================================================================================
DERIVED WORK — GNU Scientific Library (GSL)
================================================================================

PETIR is a `no_std` Rust port of parts of the GNU Scientific Library. Porting
GPL source creates a derivative work, so the upstream licence and copyright
carry over, and every ported file carries a provenance header naming the
upstream file, the commit it was read at, its copyright holder and its licence.

  Project    : GNU Scientific Library (GSL) 2.8
  Upstream   : https://git.savannah.gnu.org/git/gsl.git
  Read from  : https://github.com/ampl/gsl (mirror — savannah is unreachable
               from the build environment; see upstream_source/README.md)
  Commit     : cf180cd7fbd06039a577f9c9ff0b428784765ac1 (2026-05-19)
  Accessed   : 2026-09-14
  Licence    : GNU General Public License, version 3 or later

